{
  "version": 2,
  "guide": "docs/design/ui-guide.md",
  "note": "Machine-readable part of the GAID UI guide v2 (adopted 2026-10-22). check-ui.mjs reads locales, copyLength, internals, styles and slop; tokens, identity and components are the values the guide states, for agents and mockups. Colours, radius and motion come from web/src/app/globals.css (identity 계측 on :root/.dark, 도폭 on [data-style=\"mapsheet\"]) and are referenced by CSS variable, not repeated in components.",
